GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 25(4) the paragraph does not apply because of the free and open-source carve-out` MEANS
        `the supply`'s `the third party makes the item accessible to the public under a free and open-source licence`
    AND (NOT `the supply`'s `the item is a general-purpose AI model`)
